I go to the bus stop.
The evening time is very pleasant.
I see the red BEST bus.
The bus stops there.
I board the bus.
I give rupees to the conductor.
He gives a ticket to me.
Now there is no big crowd in the bus.
I see an empty seat.
That seat is near the window.
I sit there.
I place the bag on my lap.
I look out of the window.
The city lights shine beautifully.
A cool breeze blows.
I feel great peace.
The bus goes quickly towards my home.
